      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Step-by-Step Moving Day Workflow: Survey, Packing, Transit &amp; Placement for Packers And Movers Barhi Hazaribagh</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>Moving from Barhi to Hazaribagh can be stress‑free when you follow a structured workflow designed by professional packers and movers. Below is a step‑by‑step guide that covers every phase—from the initial pre‑move survey to the final uncrating at the destination—so you know exactly what to expect and how to prepare.</p>

<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>1. Pre‑move video/physical survey</strong>
    <ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
      <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>The moving company schedules a visit to your current residence. A senior supervisor conducts a thorough walk‑through, noting the size of each room, the weight and fragility of items, and any special handling requirements (e.g., pianos, antiques).</span></li>
      <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Using a handheld camera or smartphone, the team records a short video of the interior. This visual record helps create an accurate inventory, reduces disputes, and enables remote quote verification if you cannot be present.</span></li>
      <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Based on the survey, the mover provides a detailed quotation that includes packing materials, labor hours, vehicle type, insurance coverage, and any extra services such as disassembly or appliance servicing.</span></li>
    </ul>
  </span></li>

  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>2. Systematic room‑by‑room packing</strong>
    <ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
      <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><em>Preparation</em>: All packing supplies (double‑wall boxes, bubble wrap, packing paper, mattress covers, and sealing tape) are delivered a day before packing begins.</span></li>
      <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><em>Labeling</em>: Each box is marked with the room name, content type, and handling instructions (e.g., “Fragile – Glassware”). A master inventory sheet is created for quick reference.</span></li>
      <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><em>Packing sequence</em>: Movers start with low‑traffic areas (storage closets, garage) and finish with high‑traffic rooms (living room, kitchen). Items are wrapped individually, placed snugly in appropriately sized boxes, and sealed tightly to prevent shifting.</span></li>
      <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><em>Special items</em>: Heavy or delicate items are packed on custom‑built wooden crates or padded pallets. Electronics are wrapped in anti‑static film, and furniture is disassembled and wrapped with protective blankets.</span></li>
    </ul>
  </span></li>

  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>3. Safe transit</strong>
